    "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- Functional test `interface_bitcoin_cli.py` asserts that `-rpcwaittimeout=5` waits at least 5 wall-clock seconds before failing to connect.\r\n- Under Docker CI load the process can return a few tens of milliseconds early, failing `assert_greater_than_or_equal(time.time(), start_time + 5)` (~40ms observed).\r\n- Allow 0.5s scheduling slack so the test still checks that the wait is near the configured timeout without flaking on best-effort wall-clock timing.",
